OL,4,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,5,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,6,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,7,     Gweek, he's got culture clash cuts
OL,8,     Gfrom the likes of Om Unit, Aphex
OL,9,     GTwin, Funkadelic, OneDa and Elton
OL,10,     GJohn.
OL,11,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,12,     GSHERELLE plays some of her
OL,13,     Gfavourite techno, both new and
OL,14,     Gclassic, in preparation for
OL,15,     GSPFDJ's Sweatbox.
OL,16,G0030FThe Sweatbox
OL,17,     G30 minutes of raucous techno from
OL,18,     Gthe acclaimed Swedish DJ,
OL,19,     Gproducer and Intrepid Skin head
OL,20,     Ghoncho SPFDJ.
